User debian-tor
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor

Log notice stdout
SocksPort 0

HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/web
HiddenServicePort 80 127.0.0.1:80

HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/ssh
HiddenServicePort 4242 127.0.0.1:4242


# (Bonus, later: client authorization for THIS service only.)
# torrc — tor configuration for ft_onion
#
# tor starts as root (so it can read its files), then immediately drops
# privileges to this user. Everything under DataDirectory must belong to it.
